        "0776d01c6c63615f9a3fafcabb6adb223c9ed29f"
      ],
      "title": "HTTP/3: Don't create file scoped upgrade info on a second pass",
      "message": "HTTP/3: Don't create file scoped upgrade info on a second pass\n\nAlso, fix apparently swapped directions in http3_packet_get_direction.\nfrom_server should presumably be mapped to FROM_SERVER_TO_CLIENT.\nThe dissector itself seems to get the QUIC stream info direction\ninstead of this, so this error appears only to affect\nhttp3_get_header_value and the follow direction. (It did cause\nthe QPACK information to be stored in the \"wrong\" array value,\nbut that didn't cause problems because the wrong value was\nconsistently used.)\n\nFixup f82ed9a537379aeb29a7cd1dbe3b9e024c97ecd8\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-07-04T11:02:26.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
      "committer_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
